From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 04:45:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Budget SQLite heap for threaded Durable Objects

Reuse the platform database allocator and copy reservation for ordinary object connections. Roll back refused object SQL without resetting its actor, and return the remaining charge on confirmed close.

Part of coworkerd/coworkerd#133

diff --git a/src/workerd/api/actor-state.c++ b/src/workerd/api/actor-state.c++
